"And you know, starting next, a solo song begins, but"

301
00:26:06,455 --> 00:26:11,715
ちょっと次の1曲さ、絶対盛り上がる曲だからさ、みんなにここにいてほしいんだよね、ねね。
"the next song is definitely a hype song, so we want everyone to stay right here, Nene."

302
00:26:11,875 --> 00:26:13,055
途中退場あり。
"Midway exit allowed."

303
00:26:13,075 --> 00:26:20,935
