"Eh, why? You're exiting? No, no! If it's a weird, proper song, we'd keep going 'Ooh' and listening, but..."

304
00:26:21,055 --> 00:26:24,275
え、ちゃんとステージ上？ステージ上に！そっか！
"Eh, properly on stage? On stage! I see!"

305
00:26:24,455 --> 00:26:29,715
